4. Promo Code & Checkout – Promo-code handling, order summary, and final amount calculation.
5. Payment Processing – Payment request, success/failure/timeout handling, booking reference, and
confirmation.
6. Digital Ticket & QR Code Issuance – PDF ticket, unique QR code, download, and confirmation
email.
7. Organizer Management Portal – Event management and organizer dashboard/analytics.
8. Booking & Database Management – Correct storage, retrieval, and consistency of booking
records.
9. Security, Performance & Reliability – HTTPS, access control, response time, concurrent
requests, availability, backup/recovery, and error handling.
10. Administration & User Support – Administrative/user-management functions supported by the
SRS and system workflows.

5. Features to be Tested:
1. User Authentication – registration, login, input validation, bcrypt password hashing, JWT/token
handling, and role-based access.
2. Event Discovery – search, trending/category presentation, and genre/category filtering.
3. Seat Booking – real-time seat availability, green/red/yellow seat states, selection, temporary
