4. Checkout – order summary, promo-code processing, payment validation, and final amount
calculation.
5. Payment – gateway integration, successful transactions, failures, timeouts, and retry handling.
6. Ticket Issuance – unique booking reference, PDF ticket, QR code, download, and email
